- The route loads without error
- The actions you listed are actually present in the rendered DOM
- Any auth gates redirect as expected
Record which pages you verified in the metadata as `"verified_live": [<routes>]`.

- Keep `label` and `notes` fields terse (< 80 characters).
- The task is NOT complete while any node has status `"discovered"` — continue until every node is `"explored"` or `"skipped"`.
{%- else %}

